WEBVTT

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:34.833
Welcome back.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.958
Here's your shade, Miss.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:44.250
The sun is especially strong today.

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.875
Miss!

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.500
Welcome back, Mi--

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.875
You're late! Why weren't you
standing here waiting for me?

00:00:51.875 --> 00:00:54.167
I-I'm sorry!

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:56.958
I'll bring you a glass of
cold lemonade right away!

00:00:56.958 --> 00:00:59.292
You haven't prepared it yet?

00:00:59.292 --> 00:01:00.500
I-I'm sorr--

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.125
You really are useless.

00:01:02.125 --> 00:01:06.083
Well, I know how to
deal with a servant like you.

00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:10.958
Please forgive me!

00:01:10.958 --> 00:01:13.250
Now you deserve nothing but punishment.

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.750
What?! P-Please! Anything but that!

00:01:15.750 --> 00:01:17.875
I'll punish you!

00:01:19.417 --> 00:01:23.083
Miss... Please not that!

00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:41.667
P-Please don't...

00:01:49.208 --> 00:01:52.417
Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:53.958
Now, this side.

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:55.125
Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:01:55.125 --> 00:01:58.333
There, is this the spot? Do you like it here?

00:01:58.333 --> 00:02:00.458
Tickle, tickle, tickle...

00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:04.083
There! There! There, there, there...!

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:08.625
"Tottori Sand Dunes"

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:19.958
Akari... Mamiya...

00:02:28.625 --> 00:02:30.250
She's so cute...

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.542
...that I really wanna tease her!

00:02:33.125 --> 00:02:34.625
Say, Akari.

00:02:34.625 --> 00:02:36.750
Yes, Miss Urara?

00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:41.125
Can I do this and that to tease you?

00:02:41.125 --> 00:02:44.125
If you want money,
I'll pay you as much as you want.

00:02:44.125 --> 00:02:45.875
Of course you can!

00:02:45.875 --> 00:02:50.583
Th-Then, wear these cat ears and say, "Meow."

00:02:50.583 --> 00:02:54.167
Actually, instead,
I'd like you to tickle me again, meow!

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:59.958
I don't have the talent to create a good story!

00:04:34.917 --> 00:04:38.417
Now, that's unusual.
You didn't get enough sleep?

00:04:38.417 --> 00:04:41.292
I do yawn sometimes, you know.

00:04:41.292 --> 00:04:44.125
It took me a long time
to finish a report last night.

00:04:44.125 --> 00:04:46.250
That sounds like a lot of work.

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.958
A train is arriving.

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:55.125
Behave like a <i>butei </i>even on your way to school.

00:04:55.125 --> 00:04:58.792
Always pay attention to your
surroundings and stay on your guard.

00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:16.208
As <i>butei</i>, we should be
prepared for all sorts of situations.

00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:17.833
Y-Yes, ma'am.

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:21.958
But trying to catch your target
off guard is a good move.

00:05:21.958 --> 00:05:23.542
I'll continue to try my best!

00:05:27.333 --> 00:05:30.083
Maybe I should hire a screenwriter or something.

00:05:33.292 --> 00:05:38.458
No... I can't keep on comforting
myself with fantasies anymore.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:42.167
You dummy.

00:05:42.167 --> 00:05:43.833
You can't do that.

00:05:45.667 --> 00:05:47.500
I wanna become her friend.

00:05:52.083 --> 00:05:53.167
But...

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.375
"Ya"

00:06:03.208 --> 00:06:06.417
Whoa! Thank you, Takachiho!

00:06:06.417 --> 00:06:10.833
If you want money,
I'll pay you as much as you want.

00:06:10.833 --> 00:06:13.208
I don't know what to do.

00:06:16.708 --> 00:06:18.708
Ah! Takachiho!

00:06:18.708 --> 00:06:20.000
Ahhh!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.417
Doors are clos--

00:06:26.417 --> 00:06:28.625
H-How much is that?!

00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:30.833
Huh? How much is what?

00:06:30.833 --> 00:06:34.833
Ah! U-Uhm, th-the family restaurant
from the other day. Yep, that restaurant.

00:06:34.833 --> 00:06:35.708
Huh?

00:06:35.708 --> 00:06:40.083
How much was their
Strawberry Sundae Mille-feuille?

00:06:40.083 --> 00:06:43.167
Uhm... How much was that?

00:06:43.167 --> 00:06:47.167
I'm so good! I pulled
through with quick thinking.

00:06:47.167 --> 00:06:51.500
I'm sorry. I don't remember.
I'll check next time I go there.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.083
--Well then, my next class is that way, so...
--Ahhhh...

00:06:54.083 --> 00:06:55.000
Ahh...

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.458
See you later!

00:06:57.458 --> 00:06:59.083
Doors are closing.

00:07:04.833 --> 00:07:06.625
I can't stay like this anymore!

00:07:06.625 --> 00:07:07.167
"Article 1: Trust in your
comrades and help them."

00:07:07.167 --> 00:07:07.625
"Article 2: Abide your contract
with your client no matter what."

00:07:07.625 --> 00:07:08.125
"Article 3: Be strong, but first be righteous."

00:07:08.125 --> 00:07:08.625
"Article 4: <i>Butei </i>should be self-reliant. You don't
need to help other <i>butei </i>unless requested."

00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:09.125
"Article 5: Act quickly.
To win, always make the first move."

00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:09.625
"Article 6: Think for yourself
and act on your own."

00:07:10.083 --> 00:07:14.458
I'm Urara Takachiho!
I obtain whatever I want without fail!

00:07:14.458 --> 00:07:17.625
As such, I'll gain her
friendship by my own effort!

00:07:29.208 --> 00:07:30.375
Hm?

00:07:31.583 --> 00:07:32.958
A rose?

00:07:41.458 --> 00:07:42.792
Hm?

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:56.042
I'm home!

00:07:56.042 --> 00:07:58.042
Hi, Sis.

00:07:58.042 --> 00:07:59.417
This...

00:07:59.417 --> 00:08:00.667
--Where'd you get those roses?
--Let's go.

00:08:00.667 --> 00:08:01.750
Yeah.

00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:06.125
S-Sis, could it be you're popular among guys?

00:08:06.125 --> 00:08:08.583
I don't think so.

00:08:08.583 --> 00:08:10.208
But that card...

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:19.000
Hmm, they look out of place in our apartment.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.833
Yeah, they're in a bucket, too.

00:08:21.833 --> 00:08:24.958
I wonder who these are from.

00:08:24.958 --> 00:08:26.208
Hm?

00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:29.792
Mom! What's that?

00:08:29.792 --> 00:08:31.583
Shhh! Don't look at it!

00:08:36.542 --> 00:08:40.542
"To Akari Mamiya: Please come to
my house tomorrow night. --Urara Takachiho"

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:43.375
This is... serious!

00:08:43.375 --> 00:08:45.167
Ahhhhh!

00:08:48.167 --> 00:08:52.208
We somehow made it in time,
but what sort of operation is this?

00:08:52.208 --> 00:08:56.917
We just left flowers and a
letter there. What are they for?

00:08:56.917 --> 00:09:02.375
You're just soldiers. You don't
have to know my high-level strategy.

00:09:02.375 --> 00:09:03.292
I'm worried.

00:09:03.292 --> 00:09:06.750
Considering her grade in
"Basic Strategy" class isn't good...

00:09:08.458 --> 00:09:11.208
Is this... your room, Miss Urara?!

00:09:11.208 --> 00:09:14.333
What a lovely room! It suits you perfectly.

00:09:14.333 --> 00:09:17.542
Ah! Those roses are just like
the ones I received, so full of memories!

00:09:17.542 --> 00:09:19.792
Oh, you noticed?

00:09:19.792 --> 00:09:21.917
How wonderful! Please make me your sex slave!

00:09:21.917 --> 00:09:23.875
Oh, you are a hasty one.

00:09:28.042 --> 00:09:31.708
Well, you guys can go home
after finishing that drink.

00:09:31.708 --> 00:09:33.250
Huh?

00:09:35.958 --> 00:09:38.833
She's completely treating us like tools.

00:09:38.833 --> 00:09:41.542
She's such a slave driver.

00:09:41.542 --> 00:09:43.125
That's so...

00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:43.667
"Ya" "Yu"

00:09:43.667 --> 00:09:46.542
...wonderful!

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:56.958
Whoa...

00:09:56.958 --> 00:09:59.083
Takachiho Armed Lawyers Corporation!

00:09:59.083 --> 00:10:02.208
No objection to first-rate service!

00:10:02.208 --> 00:10:04.375
Aizawa...

00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:05.792
This way.

00:10:09.542 --> 00:10:10.917
Take a right there.

00:10:10.917 --> 00:10:12.250
Okay.

00:10:15.708 --> 00:10:19.208
Oh, no... Why are they glaring at me like that?

00:10:22.958 --> 00:10:24.083
Miss Urara.

00:10:24.083 --> 00:10:25.792
Akari's here.

00:10:25.792 --> 00:10:27.542
Whoa! She's already here!

00:10:29.667 --> 00:10:33.958
Whoa... I wonder if they had
some sort of celebration today.

00:10:44.458 --> 00:10:46.750
W-Welcome.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.792
Wow! You're beautiful, Takachiho!

00:10:49.792 --> 00:10:51.458
Th-Thanks.

00:10:53.458 --> 00:10:55.958
"100% Grape Juice for Good Kids"

00:10:56.125 --> 00:10:58.042
This is delicious!

00:11:04.667 --> 00:11:08.750
Once again, congratulations
on your promotion to D Rank.

00:11:08.750 --> 00:11:11.167
Yep, thanks!

00:11:11.167 --> 00:11:15.167
Ahh... She really is small... and cute.

00:11:15.167 --> 00:11:18.708
"Ya" "Yu"

00:11:21.167 --> 00:11:23.500
By the way, I've got a question.

00:11:23.500 --> 00:11:24.583
Hm?

00:11:26.208 --> 00:11:31.208
A-Are we... now...

00:11:31.208 --> 00:11:33.042
...friends?

00:11:33.042 --> 00:11:34.625
Huh?

00:11:34.625 --> 00:11:38.000
Ah, yeah. I think so.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:42.625
I think so... I think so... I think so...

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.000
"Victory"

00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:47.500
All right!

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:49.625
B-But...

00:11:49.625 --> 00:11:51.792
...we should be even better friends!

00:11:51.792 --> 00:11:53.708
Huh?

00:11:53.708 --> 00:11:59.708
L-L-L-Let's deepen our friendship!
Right here, right now!

00:11:59.708 --> 00:12:01.083
Slide, slide, slide...

00:12:01.083 --> 00:12:02.625
T-Takachiho?!

00:12:02.625 --> 00:12:05.083
I-If you want money, I'll pay you!

00:12:07.083 --> 00:12:07.958
Akari!

00:12:07.958 --> 00:12:09.917
Oh, Akari!

00:12:12.167 --> 00:12:13.708
Ahhhhh!

00:12:13.708 --> 00:12:16.042
I-I haven't done anything yet!

00:12:18.542 --> 00:12:19.458
Intruder!

00:12:19.458 --> 00:12:21.750
Who's actually intruding?!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.625
Stop right there, Urara Takachiho!

00:12:27.333 --> 00:12:29.292
Sh-Shino?!

00:12:29.292 --> 00:12:32.083
Akari's my friend!

00:12:32.083 --> 00:12:33.625
She's about to be snatched away from me,

00:12:33.625 --> 00:12:37.125
and I can't just stand by and let it happen!

00:12:37.125 --> 00:12:41.333
Too bad. Akari is...

00:12:41.333 --> 00:12:43.250
...already my friend!

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:44.917
Huh?

00:12:44.917 --> 00:12:49.917
Shino Sasaki. You're the kind of
person who'd ruin Akari by spoiling her.

00:12:49.917 --> 00:12:53.167
But I'm someone who can be strict with her.

00:12:53.167 --> 00:12:56.708
Akari and I can improve each other!

00:12:56.708 --> 00:12:59.583
I-Improve each other...?!

00:12:59.583 --> 00:13:00.917
Ahh...

00:13:00.917 --> 00:13:05.958
More... Improve me more!

00:13:05.958 --> 00:13:07.500
I challenge you to a duel!

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.542
What?!

00:13:08.542 --> 00:13:10.458
I'm not gonna let you have Akari!

00:13:10.458 --> 00:13:12.458
Yes, a duel is the only way to settle this.

00:13:12.458 --> 00:13:13.583
H-Hold on a sec!

00:13:13.583 --> 00:13:15.625
The time is after school tomorrow.

00:13:15.625 --> 00:13:18.792
--The place is Butei High's old training site!
--What's going on?

00:13:23.792 --> 00:13:27.042
Both of you, stop! Don't fight a duel!

00:13:27.042 --> 00:13:31.625
Akari, school rules don't
forbid us to fight a duel...

00:13:31.625 --> 00:13:36.542
...although it's not endorsed, so if someone
sees it, it'll affect our internal reports..

00:13:36.542 --> 00:13:40.458
Akari... there are times
when a woman cannot back down.

00:13:41.833 --> 00:13:43.542
Urara Takachiho...

00:13:43.542 --> 00:13:47.542
Your act towards Akari
last night was outrageous.

00:13:47.542 --> 00:13:49.083
I find you guilty!

00:13:49.083 --> 00:13:54.667
You interrupted our friendship.
You're the one who's guilty!

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:58.375
Don't underestimate me
just because I'm from Inquesta.

00:13:58.375 --> 00:14:01.250
You can go ahead and use your gun.

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:04.458
If I did, you'd be done for in a second.

00:14:04.458 --> 00:14:10.458
And I won the National
Junior-Interscholastic Fencing Meet, too!

00:14:25.208 --> 00:14:26.667
This saber is...

00:14:27.667 --> 00:14:29.792
...flexible like a whip.

00:14:45.542 --> 00:14:47.583
I'll take advantage of that flexibility!

00:14:49.333 --> 00:14:51.708
You're trying to get in close to me, aren't you?

00:14:51.708 --> 00:14:54.208
But think carefully about
the difference in our reach!

00:15:09.875 --> 00:15:13.833
Iaijutsu demands perfect
timing in one's actions.

00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:17.292
Whether or not there's a
sheath makes no difference.

00:15:18.333 --> 00:15:23.250
But I can decide to have
perfect timing at any moment!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:26.083
Both of you! You've gone far enou--

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.958
You can't go any further!

00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:37.083
I'm not gonna lose!

00:15:37.083 --> 00:15:40.625
Well... today's target practice
was boring, wasn't it?

00:15:40.625 --> 00:15:43.417
Isn't there anything interesting going on?

00:15:43.417 --> 00:15:45.208
Shall we go somewhere?

00:15:45.208 --> 00:15:46.333
Hm?

00:15:46.333 --> 00:15:47.708
I wonder what those noises are...

00:15:47.708 --> 00:15:49.833
Could it be some sort of a fight?

00:15:49.833 --> 00:15:51.750
Hey, let's go check it out!

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.250
Seriously, stop it now!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:01.583
I won't!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:09.875
If I can at least get in close to her,
I can do Tsubame Gaeshi.

00:16:09.875 --> 00:16:15.708
There, now's the time for you...
though I'm a bit too far from you, aren't I?

00:16:19.292 --> 00:16:20.958
It'll be hit or miss...

00:16:20.958 --> 00:16:22.333
Shino?

00:16:22.333 --> 00:16:24.542
What're you doing?

00:16:24.542 --> 00:16:27.833
Are you so scared that
you're panicking or something?

00:16:27.833 --> 00:16:29.375
I have no choice but to take a chance.

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:35.500
Please... Please...

00:16:38.167 --> 00:16:39.792
...work!

00:16:39.792 --> 00:16:41.375
Whoa!

00:16:41.375 --> 00:16:43.000
Tsubame Gaeshi!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.208
Oh, no!

00:16:50.958 --> 00:16:52.667
Ahh... Ah-choo!

00:16:58.917 --> 00:17:01.375
C-Calm down, Shino.

00:17:01.375 --> 00:17:04.833
It's not like my Tsubame Gaeshi was broken.

00:17:04.833 --> 00:17:10.458
I-I'm so good. I splendidly turned
an accident into an opportunity.

00:17:10.458 --> 00:17:11.000
So...

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:11.958
Huh?

00:17:11.958 --> 00:17:17.000
How did... A-Akari's chest smell?

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:19.625
Wh-Why don't <i>you </i>tell me?

00:17:19.625 --> 00:17:23.792
I know you have Akari's pillow!

00:17:23.792 --> 00:17:28.167
Don't tell me you threw away
the straw Akari used last night.

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:29.833
Of course not.

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:32.875
D-Do you have something
to give to me in exchange?

00:17:32.875 --> 00:17:37.542
I-I got some of her hair in my Akari Box.
I'll give you two strands.

00:17:37.542 --> 00:17:38.500
Five strands.

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:41.042
How greedy! You're just like your father!

00:17:41.042 --> 00:17:41.750
Three!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:42.542
Four!

00:17:42.542 --> 00:17:45.083
--Three should be enough!
--Hm? Well, are they discussing something?

00:17:45.083 --> 00:17:50.208
---But they'll just be for viewing!
--Maybe they can make up?

00:17:50.208 --> 00:17:52.625
Wow! This is cool!

00:17:52.625 --> 00:17:54.042
Are you fighting a duel?

00:17:54.042 --> 00:17:55.458
How wonderful!

00:17:55.458 --> 00:17:57.375
Can we take some pictures?!

00:17:57.375 --> 00:17:58.792
Th-They saw the du--

00:17:58.792 --> 00:18:00.292
Stay that way.

00:18:00.292 --> 00:18:02.833
Could you show a different angle?

00:18:02.833 --> 00:18:04.083
You two are cool!

00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:05.667
Can I upload the vide--

00:18:05.667 --> 00:18:07.208
Stop it!

00:18:09.292 --> 00:18:11.000
This isn't a show!

00:18:20.250 --> 00:18:21.500
Akari!

00:19:02.917 --> 00:19:05.125
What were you thinking?! That was dangerous!

00:19:05.125 --> 00:19:08.500
She's right! If something
happened to you, I'd be so...

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:11.708
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

00:19:11.708 --> 00:19:17.333
But I trusted that you two
would help each other, so...

00:19:17.333 --> 00:19:21.583
Shino... Takachiko... You performed
together in harmony earlier.

00:19:25.375 --> 00:19:29.917
Well, I don't really know why
you two wanted to fight a duel,

00:19:29.917 --> 00:19:32.417
but Shino and I are friends.

00:19:32.417 --> 00:19:35.042
Takachiho and I are friends, too.

00:19:35.042 --> 00:19:37.333
So...

00:19:37.333 --> 00:19:41.667
...you two are friends, too,
Shino and Takachiho!

00:19:41.667 --> 00:19:44.167
We can all be friends!

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:48.875
What a sinful angel!

00:19:53.708 --> 00:19:55.875
Shino...

00:19:55.875 --> 00:20:02.417
You're the one who understood
Akari's intension and made a dash first.

00:20:02.417 --> 00:20:06.375
It means that your love for
Akari was stronger than mine!

00:20:06.375 --> 00:20:08.542
Whoa, she said it so clearly...

00:20:08.542 --> 00:20:10.208
Love?

00:20:10.208 --> 00:20:14.542
But I haven't given up my friendship with Akari.

00:20:14.542 --> 00:20:17.667
Besides, we haven't settled the duel yet.

00:20:17.667 --> 00:20:21.000
You and I will continue to be good rivals.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:22.792
Akari, be careful.

00:20:22.792 --> 00:20:25.167
I bet Shino wants to do it with you, too.

00:20:25.167 --> 00:20:27.333
Do what?

00:20:27.333 --> 00:20:28.875
Sp...ing,

00:20:28.875 --> 00:20:30.333
Ge...ing into y... ...rt,

00:20:30.333 --> 00:20:33.458
Cud... with ea... and all sorts of other things!

00:20:35.292 --> 00:20:37.125
Huh?

00:20:50.917 --> 00:20:54.000
I heard that you became close to Takachiho.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.292
Yes! We're friends!

00:20:56.292 --> 00:20:58.208
You had to work on another report?

00:20:58.208 --> 00:20:59.583
Yeah.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.250
There've been a lot of them lately.

00:21:08.167 --> 00:21:09.417
Aria!

00:21:09.417 --> 00:21:10.583
Hm?

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.583
I'll get it back... someday for sure!

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:39.333
When are you thinking of taking action?

00:21:39.333 --> 00:21:42.250
Hmm... I'll wait a bit longer.

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:44.792
I'm sorry to keep you waiting, though.

00:21:44.792 --> 00:21:46.750
You can take your time...

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:49.167
...since I've got stuff to do myself.

00:21:49.167 --> 00:21:53.958
Why are you painting
your nails in different colors?

00:21:53.958 --> 00:21:59.958
I want to carry around as
much of my collection as possible.

00:21:59.958 --> 00:22:01.417
I see...

00:22:05.833 --> 00:22:07.125
"Episode 6: Little Devils' Request"

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:08.958
"Episode 6: Little Devils' Request"
Collection, huh...?

00:23:41.542 --> 00:23:44.375
Welcome to the Spa Resort Takachiho!

00:23:44.375 --> 00:23:45.083
All right!

00:23:45.083 --> 00:23:46.750
You're a defenseless little goldfish...

00:23:46.750 --> 00:23:48.000
I-I can swim!

00:23:48.000 --> 00:23:49.000
You can't do that here!

00:23:49.000 --> 00:23:49.958
Hey, what are you touching?!

00:23:49.958 --> 00:23:51.875
How shameless!

00:23:53.542 --> 00:23:55.208
This is a special bathing suit.

00:23:55.250 --> 00:23:56.203
"Episode 8: Pool Trap"
